ebSockets.</p>\n<p>• <strong>AutoBio App</strong>: <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.auto.bio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Google Play</a> | <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/eg/app/autobio-%D8%A7%D9%88%D8%AA%D9%88-%D8%A8%D9%8A%D9%88/id6745604895\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">App Store</a></p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Magsala – Multi-Vendor Laundry Ecosystem","tech":["PHP","Laravel","MySQL","Flutter","RESTful API","Moyasar Payment","Realtime"],"github":null,"external":null,"playstore":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.fastlaundry.customerapp","appstore":"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6743033070","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#f8f8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/2aefc/magsala.png","srcSet":"/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/d9a64/magsala.png 75w,\n/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/63ded/magsala.png 150w,\n/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/2aefc/magsala.png 300w,\n/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/487f6/magsala.png 600w","sizes":"(min-width: 300px) 300px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/1b6fd/magsala.avif 75w,\n/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/d9380/magsala.avif 150w,\n/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/0a334/magsala.avif 300w,\n/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/c6012/magsala.avif 600w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 300px) 300px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/13934/magsala.webp 75w,\n/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/82107/magsala.webp 150w,\n/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/5df15/magsala.webp 300w,\n/static/03e5e458051c764b04da9933fbf94ab2/ac2b4/magsala.webp 600w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 300px) 300px, 100vw"}]},"width":300,"height":129}}}},"html":"<p>Architected and developed a comprehensive multi-vendor 